    "longBusinessSummary": "Apollo Techno Industries Limited engages in the engineering and manufacturing of trenchless technology and foundation equipment for the construction industry in India. The company manufactures horizontal directional drilling rigs, a trenchless technology for installation of essential utilities, such as gas pipelines, water supply lines, sewer lines, optical fibre cables, and electrical conduits; diaphragm wall drilling rigs used in constructing foundations for deep basements, retaining walls in railway, and airports and metro stations, as well as developments along riverfronts; and rotary drilling rigs for high-rise buildings, bridges, urban infrastructure, metro and rapid rail connectivity, flyovers, and general construction. The company also offers spare parts, which includes drill rods, hydraulic pumps, filters, oil seals, electric components, etc.; and warranties, on-site support, and technical training services. It exports in Nepal, the United Arab Emirates, the Middle East, and Russia. The company was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Mahesana, India.",
